{"thread":{"threadID":4775,"boardID":117,"topic":"Team News - 19.09.2017","time":1505842241,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1506111078,"lastPoster":"Ecoplox","replies":20,"views":1001,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":4},"tags":[{"tagID":9,"name":"admin"},{"tagID":880,"name":"admin+"},{"tagID":1151,"name":"apudox"},{"tagID":70,"name":"dream"},{"tagID":1241,"name":"mason"},{"tagID":23,"name":"news"},{"tagID":1240,"name":"pikachu"},{"tagID":1239,"name":"thorin"},{"tagID":931,"name":"uprank"}],"posts":[{"postID":72058,"threadID":4775,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Team News - 19.09.2017","time":1505842241,"lastEditTime":1506119716,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1505842352,"value":1},{"userID":2648,"username":"Winnie","time":1505842422,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1505842451,"value":1},{"userID":2607,"username":"SkuLz","time":1505842667,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1505842871,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1505851705,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1505851735,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1505923414,"value":1},{"userID":2611,"username":"FantasyGamer29","time":1506014464,"value":1},{"userID":2647,"username":"Ecoplox","time":1506069126,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1505842963,"value":-1},{"userID":2368,"username":"Zelimirus","time":1505843118,"value":-1},{"userID":2326,"username":"Unicorn24","time":1505849153,"value":-1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1505854611,"value":-1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1505943477,"value":-1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1505983252,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br>Da ich zurzeit nicht Zuhause bin, hat sich diese News ein wenig verschoben, tut mir Leid dafür.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>ApudoX hat einen Uprank zum Administrator+ erhalten</strong><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> hat seine zweite Chance im Team sehr gut genutzt und aus seinen vorherigen Fehlern gelernt. Er ist ein sehr loyaler, aktiver und kompetenter Admin und übte die Position des Admin+ bereits aus. Es spricht rein gar nichts dagegen, ihn nicht wieder in diese Position aufzunehmen.<br>Herzlichen Glückwunsch, Apudox!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Mason received an uprank from an Administrator to an </strong><strong>Administrator+</strong><br><strong></strong><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2404-mas0n/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mas0n</a> has been an admin for quite some time now and although he has minor issues, he overcame those and has worked on improving himself. He is a very active admin and has been there for users when they need help. Also, he shows interest in improving the community as a whole, which is something notable. Now, he got his well deserved uprank, congratulations!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Thorin Pikachu received an uprank from an Administrator to an </strong><strong>Administrator+</strong><br><strong></strong><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2335-thorin-pikachu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Thorin Pikachu</a> was not as active as the other admins but he made up for it by not participating in any drama and always being a clearheaded person. When there is a fight ensuing, he is always trying to end it and sticks with the community, if necessary. He has been an Admin for quite some time now, so there should be some kind of reward for him handling different situations well and staying loyal to the community.<br>Congratulations!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ein zusätzliches Hallo an unseren neuen Supporter <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2611-fantasygamer29/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@FantasyGamer29</a>, <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2716-menoc/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Menoc</a> und <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2511-xlaer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Xlaer</a>. Ich hatte noch nicht die Gelegenheit mit allen von euch zu reden, aber zögert nicht zu mir zu kommen, solltet ihr Fragen oder Probleme haben.</p></div><p><br>Gruß<br>Nachtfrische</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":72060,"threadID":4775,"userID":2605,"username":"qlassic","subject":"","time":1505842652,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1505842982,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1505843274,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1505855948,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>Er ist ein sehr loyaler, aktiver und kompetenter Admin<br></p></blockquote><p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2043-apudox/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ApudoX</a> Kompetent? Alles klar. Den Uprank hat er nicht verdient.  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2404-mas0n/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Mas0n</a> Congratulations <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2335-thorin-pikachu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Thorin Pikachu</a> aswell Congratz <span class=\"missing-media\">[;)]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":72062,"threadI